            {
                "entry_id": "2bc9277d-1778-399d-8d87-25b9e2090210",
                "word": "couth",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1164503f-955d-4e3a-a714-2b7d412d427d",
                        "entry_id": "2bc9277d-1778-399d-8d87-25b9e2090210",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "couths"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a2ccad11-b03c-3f1a-ac56-6e5e17c6eef0",
                        "entry_id": "2bc9277d-1778-399d-8d87-25b9e2090210",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Social grace, refinement, sophistication; etiquette, manners."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2d0213f8-e351-47ce-8669-ceca8ff9b458",
                                "sense_id": "a2ccad11-b03c-3f1a-ac56-6e5e17c6eef0",
                                "text": "That man has no couth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b95c49de-da0a-404f-974d-1de89502f56a",
                                "sense_id": "a2ccad11-b03c-3f1a-ac56-6e5e17c6eef0",
                                "text": "There is an aspect of the cultural conservative argument that sometimes drifts dangerously close to tha view, elitist to the core, as elitist as the New Class, as elitist as limousine liberalism: The public ain't got no couth. You can hear those old-fashioned elitist wheels spinning: Maybe we need a few government regulations to deal with the couth shortage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a57d914-07c6-4913-9a11-bb9167ecfa1c",
                                "sense_id": "a2ccad11-b03c-3f1a-ac56-6e5e17c6eef0",
                                "text": "My daughters have long and inappropriately been members of the Committee to Reform Dad's Hygiene, taking me to task for my supposed lack of couth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf1fe4f6-3acd-410f-8409-d1f481a47e6b",
                                "sense_id": "a2ccad11-b03c-3f1a-ac56-6e5e17c6eef0",
                                "text": "Couth and manners are intensely subjective concepts. Each culture has its own standards of acceptable table manners, for instance."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f9854c9-8c21-4712-9c2d-724c81701a45",
                                "sense_id": "a2ccad11-b03c-3f1a-ac56-6e5e17c6eef0",
                                "text": "You got no couth, Ed. You was raised no-count is what you were. No count and you ain't got a lick of couth."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a75bcf66-220e-3940-b300-f2a59763c7ef",
                        "entry_id": "2bc9277d-1778-399d-8d87-25b9e2090210",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person with social graces; a refined or sophisticated person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare",
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bcf91e9-c115-4162-bf26-75b1b25eb6d9",
                                "sense_id": "a75bcf66-220e-3940-b300-f2a59763c7ef",
                                "text": "We transformed the uncouths into couths, the unkempts into kempts, the inerts into erts! We did it all by speaking to teen-agers on their own terms and in their own language."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d7717e2-a83b-490c-9882-9a7c2dea5f9a",
                                "sense_id": "a75bcf66-220e-3940-b300-f2a59763c7ef",
                                "text": "I'm going to hit that \"Gulf of Texas\" beach with a bundle of couths and suaves because those Texas gals that hang around the big shrimp boats are used to good living."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8dbf15b-7ddf-448a-ab9a-7477063d0c8d",
                        "source_entry_id": "2bc9277d-1778-399d-8d87-25b9e2090210",
                        "source_sense_description": "social grace, refinement, sophistication — see also refinement, sophistication",
                        "target_lang_word": "raffinement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "raffinement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "731d4a46-5c3d-3b43-88bb-bf1b07eb1424",
                                        "entry_id": "fef0ec54-4342-3170-bf57-75ae14b316f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extrême subtilité ; délicatesse particulière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff1566a0-98c0-4434-bff9-cc60002af3fd",
                                                "sense_id": "731d4a46-5c3d-3b43-88bb-bf1b07eb1424",
                                                "text": "Depuis son installation, assez récente, à Paris, où il habitait un magnifique hôtel, avenue de Friedland, il avait fait venir au Havre son beau yacht, le dernier raffinement du suprême confort, qui autrefois chauffait dans le port de New-York, toujours prêt à lever l'ancre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8b17db6-126d-4a97-90c6-fec138e61dc8",
                                                "sense_id": "731d4a46-5c3d-3b43-88bb-bf1b07eb1424",
                                                "text": "La délicatesse de son langage va jusqu’au raffinement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b5f5ad5-fabf-439c-be06-423cd7b462af",
                                                "sense_id": "731d4a46-5c3d-3b43-88bb-bf1b07eb1424",
                                                "text": "Les raffinements du style, des manières, du goût."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "013ebd4c-60eb-3f46-8414-88cd32ea258e",
                                        "entry_id": "fef0ec54-4342-3170-bf57-75ae14b316f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excès de recherche que l’on met en certaines actions, en certaines habitudes de la vie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "424cd4f0-ad1a-4fa7-96c0-f5808d2551b4",
                                                "sense_id": "013ebd4c-60eb-3f46-8414-88cd32ea258e",
                                                "text": "Les raffinements du luxe. Un raffinement de cruauté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a591bcfe-b9b1-44b9-8d6e-22e377d5aa10",
                                                "sense_id": "013ebd4c-60eb-3f46-8414-88cd32ea258e",
                                                "text": "La flagellation avait pour fonction déterminante de « préparer » le supplice de la crucifixion. Elle supposait un abominable raffinement puisque tout l’art du bourreau consistait à châtier le condamné, sans l’achever prématurément."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49c1a2d0-0aaa-3985-bc4d-6647b78d6905",
                                        "entry_id": "fef0ec54-4342-3170-bf57-75ae14b316f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Choses raffinées."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb2f0498-c3dc-4a97-90e1-f5a32c56d153",
                                                "sense_id": "49c1a2d0-0aaa-3985-bc4d-6647b78d6905",
                                                "text": "La foule entend désormais jouir des raffinements réservés naguère à de peu nombreux privilégiés."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1eb54b41-4100-4b87-a27e-45841a609c95",
                        "source_entry_id": "2bc9277d-1778-399d-8d87-25b9e2090210",
                        "source_sense_description": "social grace, refinement, sophistication — see also refinement, sophistication",
                        "target_lang_word": "sophistication",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sophistication",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c60bded5-de2b-371c-a364-d7bbe982014b",
                                        "entry_id": "be0a059c-6487-322d-9c92-2c511a68fa74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de sophistiquer, de frelater des produits."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "921efe88-6020-34a0-a2b1-cde4697200dc",
                                        "entry_id": "be0a059c-6487-322d-9c92-2c511a68fa74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Action de rendre complexe ou compliqué ce qui pourrait être simple."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de46fab-c387-4715-b43e-6b489e4c6d88",
                                                "sense_id": "921efe88-6020-34a0-a2b1-cde4697200dc",
                                                "text": "Très souvent, en économie, les mathématiques ne sont rien de plus qu'une sophistication inutile (que Keynes avait su dénoncer - il parlait à leur propos de niaiseries formalisées), du merdouillage. Ici, je crois qu'il faut être absolument net. Mathématiser l'économie, ça n'a rien à voir avec forger un concept économique qui aurait sa valeur propre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2ce0f6f-1648-45e4-af5e-1a8c98e80424",
                                                "sense_id": "921efe88-6020-34a0-a2b1-cde4697200dc",
                                                "text": "La sophistication peut se situer au niveau de l'utilisation du produit ; c'est le cas pour le prêt hypothécaire, accordé (« vendu ») en racontant à un emprunteur, […], une faribole fine comme du gros sel : comme quoi il lui sera toujours possible de se désendetter en revendant sa maison plus cher que son prix d'achat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
